<h1>Product Reviews &amp; Evaluations</h1>
<p class="lead">Independent product research. Clear evaluations. More informed shopping.</p>
<p>Buy Better Finds evaluates products using our Buy Better Score framework. We review available specifications, features, intended uses, practical considerations, value, and tradeoffs to help shoppers understand what a product offers and who it may suit.</p>
<p>Most evaluations are research-based, not hands-on product tests. We clearly identify hands-on testing when it has actually taken place, and we distinguish firsthand observations from manufacturer information and other research.</p>
<div class="card" style="margin:2rem 0;padding:1.5rem">
