<ul>
<li>Product research and review of available specifications</li>
<li>Assessment of intended use, features, practicality, and value</li>
<li>Clear explanation of strengths, limitations, and tradeoffs</li>
<li>A Buy Better Score based on our editorial framework</li>
<li>Transparent affiliate disclosures and testing status</li>
</ul>
